%N A400565 Nonsquarefree numbers k such that sigma(k) = phi(k) + tau(k)^8.
%C A400565 All squarefree numbers k such that sigma(k) = phi(k) + tau(k)^8 are terms of the sequence A398797.
%C A400565 a(8)..a(15) <= 157174639221889, 3160948749342174, 3251710709765140, 4015113649319540, 4394322707554276, 4563661060732095, 5210974173349676, 5930462435856615 respectively. - _David A. Corneth_, Sep 30 2026
%H A400565 S. I. Dimitrov, <a href="https://github.com/Stoyan16/Non-squarefree-numbers-k-such-that-sigma-k-phi-k-tau-k-8/blob/main/A400565">Python program</a> (GitHub)
%e A400565 252930380 is a term since sigma(252930380) = 531153840 = 101172144 + 12^8 = phi(252930380) + tau(252930380)^8.
%o A400565 (PARI) isok(k) = {my(f = factor(k)); !issquarefree(f) && sigma(f) - eulerphi(f) == numdiv(f)^8; } \\ _Amiram Eldar_, Sep 30 2026
